          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bayangkan array seperti bilah inventaris. Sebuah slot dapat menyimpan variabel atau nilai apa pun, baik string, boolean, maupun angka seperti <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setiap elemen dalam array memiliki posisi bernomor yang disebut indeks.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indeks dimulai dari 0 dan bertambah pada setiap nilai berikutnya. Artinya, elemen kedua dalam <code>playerStats</code> berada pada indeks <code>1</code>. Tulis kode untuk indeks tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mengakses elemen seperti nilai <code>true</code>, tulis nama array <code>playerStats</code> diikuti indeks elemen di antara tanda kurung siku <code>[2]</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>playerStats</code>, diikuti oleh <code>[</code>, lalu <code>2</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memperbarui nilai pada indeks kedua, akses nilai tersebut melalui <code>playerStats[2]</code>, lalu gunakan <code>=</code> untuk menetapkan nilai baru seperti <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>playerStats[2]</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Meskipun array memiliki empat elemen, indeks terakhir yang dapat kita akses adalah <code>3</code> karena pengindeksan dimulai dari 0.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis nilai apa saja yang dapat disimpan oleh array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai apa pun, termasuk string, angka, dan boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya string</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nilai apa pun, termasuk string, angka, dan boolean.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk posisi suatu elemen dalam array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indeks elemen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nomor elemen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indeks elemen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indeks berapa yang dimiliki elemen dalam array ini?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara mengakses elemen dalam array ini?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>loot[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>loot[\"gem\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>loot[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara memperbarui sebuah nilai dalam array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita mengakses nilainya berdasarkan indeksnya, lalu menetapkan nilai lain</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak dapat memperbarui nilai dalam array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita mengakses nilainya berdasarkan indeksnya, lalu menetapkan nilai lain.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indeks mana yang bisa kita akses dalam array dengan dua elemen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code> dan <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> dan <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> dan <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan nilai <code>false</code> ke dalam array ini.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOptions = [\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pastikan <code>\"sword\"</code> berada pada indeks <code>0</code>, dan <code>\"shield\"</code> berada pada indeks <code>1</code>, dengan menulis kode untuk <code>\"sword\"</code> lalu <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bow&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equipment = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equipment);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"sword\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147912,
